    "description": {
      "value": "<p>One plant in your Greenhouse has three magical fruits growing on it. Any creature that eats one of these fruits gains the benefit of a @UUID[Compendium.dnd-players-handbook.spells.Item.phbsplLesserRest]{Lesser Restoration} spell. Fruits that aren’t eaten within 24 hours of being picked lose their magic. The plant replaces all picked fruits daily at dawn, and it can’t be transplanted without killing it.</p>",
